  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "🚚 Food Truck Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for a food truck, food van or street food stall, from Wheel Good Food to Bessie the Burger Van."
    },
    "intro": "Good food truck names are short, loud and say what you cook, so people choose you from across a festival field: <em>Seoul Train Street Kitchen</em>, <em>Bun &amp; Gone</em>, <em>Agave Street Tacos</em>. This **food truck name generator** gives you names in eight styles, from punny to taco and BBQ names, for trucks in the US and food vans in the UK.",
    "sections": [
